{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "KJV1769",
  "book_code": "MAL",
  "chapter": 1,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "MAL.1.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MAL.1.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The burden of the word of the LORD to Israel by Malachi.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "MAL.1.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MAL.1.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I have loved you, saith the LORD. Yet ye say, Wherein hast thou loved us? ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "Was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not Esau Jacob’s brother? saith the LORD: yet I loved Jacob,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAL.1.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MAL.1.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And I hated Esau, and laid his mountains and his heritage waste for the dragons of the wilderness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAL.1.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MAL.1.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whereas Edom saith, We are impoverished, but we will return and build the desolate places; thus saith the LORD of hosts, They shall build, but I will throw down; and they shall call them, The border of wickedness, and, The people against whom the LORD hath indignation for ever.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAL.1.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MAL.1.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And your eyes shall see, and ye shall say, The LORD will be magnified from the border of Israel.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAL.1.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MAL.1.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "¶ A son honoureth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " father, and a servant his master: if then I ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a father, where ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " mine honour? and if I ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a master, where ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my fear? saith the LORD of hosts unto you, O priests, that despise my name. And ye say, Wherein have we despised thy name?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "MAL.1.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MAL.1.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ye offer polluted bread upon mine altar; and ye say, Wherein have we polluted thee? In that ye say, The table of the LORD ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " contemptible.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAL.1.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MAL.1.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And if ye offer the blind for sacrifice, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not evil? and if ye offer the lame and sick, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not evil? offer it now unto thy governor; will he be pleased with thee, or accept thy person? saith the LORD of hosts.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAL.1.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MAL.1.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And now, I pray you, beseech God that he will be gracious unto us: this hath been by your means: will he regard your persons? saith the LORD of hosts.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAL.1.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MAL.1.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is there",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " even among you that would shut the doors ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "for nought?",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " neither do ye kindle ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "fire",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " on mine altar for nought. I have no pleasure in you, saith the LORD of hosts, neither will I accept an offering at your hand.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAL.1.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MAL.1.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For from the rising of the sun even unto the going down of the same my name ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " great among the Gentiles; and in every place incense ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " offered unto my name, and a pure offering: for my name ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " great among the heathen, saith the LORD of hosts.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAL.1.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MAL.1.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "¶ But ye have profaned it, in that ye say, The table of the LORD ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " polluted; and the fruit thereof, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " his meat, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " contemptible.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "MAL.1.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MAL.1.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ye said also, Behold, what a weariness ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is it!",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " and ye have snuffed at it, saith the LORD of hosts; and ye brought ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that which was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " torn, and the lame, and the sick; thus ye brought an offering: should I accept this of your hand? saith the LORD.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAL.1.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:MAL.1.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But cursed ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the deceiver, which hath in his flock a male, and voweth, and sacrificeth unto the Lord a corrupt thing: for I ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "am",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a great King, saith the LORD of hosts, and my name ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " dreadful among the heathen.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
